    { "shot": 6, "camera": "Over-shoulder, skyline hazy below her.", "action": "'Skyline my witness, I ain't waiting on luck' — she throws an arm out toward the city, claiming it.", "sfx": "Sub-bass hit, wind, city rumble." },
