@Hailuo_AI MiniMax H3 feels like a really good fit for interactive game concepts.

It handled the UI motion, selection flow, and transitions between game screens in one continuous shot, making it much easier to take an early idea to something that already feels close to a finished sequence.

Sharing the prompt below ↓

